INSERT INTO commentaries (author, book, chapter, verse, text) VALUES ('Faithlife Study Bible', 'Jeremias', 50, 17, 'Israel is a sheep scattered See v. 6 and note.

the king of Assyria Conquered the northern kingdom of Israel in 722 BC. See 2 Kgs 17:6; see note on Isa 10:5.

